        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jorge Dorado\n- Works: La guerra, Nuevos tiempos, Mindscape, Anna\n- Awards: Goya Awards\n- Topics: directorial debut, psychological thriller film, international co-production\n\nFacts:\n- Jorge Dorado received Goya Award nominations for the short film \"La guerra\" and the documentary short \"Nuevos tiempos\".\n- In 2013, \"Mindscape\" was released as an internationally co-produced psychological thriller film.\n- \"Mindscape\" is also known as \"Anna\".\n- \"Mindscape\" was Jorge Dorado's directorial feature film debut.\n- Jorge Dorado received a Goya Award nomination for \"Mindscape\".",
